WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.544 --> 00:00:20.497
Ethan looked worried as he came into Kids Central.

2
00:00:20.498 --> 00:00:23.375
"What's wrong?" Jason asked.

3
00:00:23.376 --> 00:00:26.899
"I forgot to feed Blue this morning."

4
00:00:26.900 --> 00:00:29.993
Blue was Ethan's new pet parrot.

5
00:00:29.994 --> 00:00:34.104
"He'll be okay until you get home," Jason said.

6
00:00:34.105 --> 00:00:38.295
Ethan nodded. "He had some food left in his cage.

7
00:00:38.296 --> 00:00:41.734
But it's my job to take care of him.

8
00:00:41.735 --> 00:00:46.220
Mom said I can't keep him if I keep forgetting stuff."

9
00:00:46.221 --> 00:00:49.410
"Guess what, Ethan," Miss Shelly said.

10
00:00:49.411 --> 00:00:53.540
"We're going to play a memory game today."

11
00:00:53.541 --> 00:00:57.143
"I bet I know this game!" Izzie said.

12
00:00:57.144 --> 00:01:00.774
"Each person adds something to a list.

13
00:01:00.775 --> 00:01:04.458
The next person repeats everything in order.

14
00:01:04.459 --> 00:01:12.951
Then that person has to add something new to the list."

15
00:01:12.952 --> 00:01:15.404
"Right," Miss Shelly said.

16
00:01:15.405 --> 00:01:18.483
"There are lots of different ways to play.

17
00:01:18.484 --> 00:01:22.995
We're going to play using school as our theme."

18
00:01:22.996 --> 00:01:25.230
Ethan slid down in his seat.

19
00:01:25.231 --> 00:01:29.078
"I'm going to stink at this game," he thought.

20
00:01:29.079 --> 00:01:32.312
Just then someone came into the gym.

21
00:01:32.313 --> 00:01:35.606
Ethan saw it was Ms. Folani, the principal.

22
00:01:35.607 --> 00:01:38.946
"What are you kids doing today?" she asked.

23
00:01:38.947 --> 00:01:42.936
"We're about to play a memory game," Bobby said.

24
00:01:42.937 --> 00:01:44.957
"Want to play?"

25
00:01:44.958 --> 00:01:48.154
"Sure," Ms. Folani said.

26
00:01:48.155 --> 00:01:51.077
"I can be the recorder."

27
00:01:51.078 --> 00:01:56.090
"Great." Miss Shelly slid a pad and pen across the table.

28
00:01:56.091 --> 00:01:58.530
"I'll start," Jason said.

29
00:01:58.531 --> 00:02:02.477
"Before I go to school, I'm going to . . ."

30
00:02:02.478 --> 00:02:04.415
He thought for a second.

31
00:02:04.416 --> 00:02:07.099
"Brush my teeth."

32
00:02:07.100 --> 00:02:08.808
Izzie was next.

33
00:02:08.809 --> 00:02:12.652
"Before I go to school, I'm going to brush my teeth.

34
00:02:12.653 --> 00:02:16.805
Then I'll comb my hair."

35
00:02:16.806 --> 00:02:19.547
"This is easy," Nina said.

36
00:02:19.548 --> 00:02:23.975
"Before I go to school, I'm going to brush my teeth.

37
00:02:23.976 --> 00:02:28.845
Then comb my hair and tie my shoes."

38
00:02:28.846 --> 00:02:32.820
Ms. Folani wrote down each item, keeping her list hidden.

39
00:02:32.821 --> 00:02:37.532
"No peeking!" she said.

40
00:02:37.533 --> 00:02:39.816
"I'm going to brush my teeth."

41
00:02:39.817 --> 00:02:43.496
Bobby held up one finger as he listed each item.

42
00:02:43.497 --> 00:02:47.071
"I'll comb my hair and tie my shoes.

43
00:02:47.072 --> 00:02:51.589
Then I'm going to put my baseball glove in my backpack."

44
00:02:51.590 --> 00:02:54.636
Izzie slapped a hand against her forehead.

45
00:02:54.637 --> 00:03:00.349
"That's four things. The game is getting harder!"

46
00:03:00.350 --> 00:03:03.743
Ethan closed his eyes to help him remember.

47
00:03:03.744 --> 00:03:07.200
"Your turn, Miss Shelly," Nina said.

48
00:03:07.201 --> 00:03:09.382
Miss Shelly smiled.

49
00:03:09.383 --> 00:03:13.388
"I'm going to brush my teeth and comb my hair.

50
00:03:13.389 --> 00:03:18.646
I'll tie my shoes and put my baseball glove in my backpack.

51
00:03:18.647 --> 00:03:25.694
Then . . . I'm going to finish my homework!"

52
00:03:25.695 --> 00:03:29.756
"You should do your homework the night before!" Jason said.

53
00:03:29.757 --> 00:03:36.815
Everybody laughed. "That's right, Jason!" Ms. Folani said.

54
00:03:36.816 --> 00:03:41.257
Jason looked at Ethan. "Your turn."

55
00:03:41.258 --> 00:03:47.309
"I'm going to school and . . ." Ethan tried to remember the first thing.

56
00:03:47.310 --> 00:03:51.205
"You can do it!" Bobby said.

57
00:03:51.206 --> 00:03:53.833
Ethan took a deep breath.

58
00:03:53.834 --> 00:03:57.953
He had to learn to remember things if he wanted to keep Blue!

59
00:03:57.954 --> 00:04:04.864
"I'll brush my teeth, comb my hair, and tie my shoes." He looked at Bobby.

60
00:04:04.865 --> 00:04:10.392
"I'll put my baseball glove in my backpack, and . . ."

61
00:04:10.393 --> 00:04:12.349
He looked at Miss Shelly.

62
00:04:12.350 --> 00:04:14.895
"I'll finish my homework."

63
00:04:14.896 --> 00:04:19.304
"Yeah! You did it," everyone yelled.

64
00:04:19.305 --> 00:04:22.657
"And then . . ." Ethan grinned.

65
00:04:22.658 --> 00:04:29.284
"I'll feed my pet parrot!"
